Core/Jessie: You’re holed up in a lab, right? What kind?
Core/Rose: University research lab. Plant biology wing.
Core/Jessie: Ironic.
Core/Rose: Very. But it’s got generators, water filtration, and a roof access for the radio tower.
Core/Jessie: And no one else thought to go there?
Core/Rose: Most people ran for the evacuation zones or their homes. Campus was already empty by the time I got back.
Core/Jessie: Lucky for you.
Core/Rose: …Yeah. Lucky.